### transactions-service directly: record a debit (amount in paise: 200 is rupees 2.00)
POST http://localhost:8001/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "account_id": "acc-2", "amount_cents": 200, "kind": "debit" }

### transactions-service directly: list an account's transactions
GET http://localhost:8001/v1/transactions/acc-2

### ledger-service directly: the summary for an account
GET http://localhost:8002/v1/accounts/acc-2/summary

### health of each service
GET http://localhost:8001/health
